#: org.kde.hashomatic.metainfo.xml:8
msgid "Hash-o-matic"
msgstr "Hash-o-matic"

#. (itstool) path: component/summary
#. +> trunk6
#: org.kde.hashomatic.metainfo.xml:9
msgid "Check hashes for your files"
msgstr "Verificar as sumas de comprobacións de ficheiros."

#. (itstool) path: component/developer_name
#. +> trunk6
#: org.kde.hashomatic.metainfo.xml:12
msgid "The KDE Community"
msgstr "Comunidade KDE"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#. +> trunk6
#: org.kde.hashomatic.metainfo.xml:22
msgid "Verifying that a file you downloaded or received is actually the one you were expecting is often overlooked or too time-consuming to do. At the same time, it has become very easy to get your hands on a file that has been tampered with, due to the mass increase of malicious webpages and other actors."
msgstr "Verificar que un ficheiro  descargado ou recibido é o que se espera adoita deixarse de lado ou requirir moito tempo. Por outra banda, cada vez é máis fácil acabar cun ficheiro que se alterou, por mor do aumento masivo de páxinas web maliciosas e outros actores."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#. +> trunk6
#: org.kde.hashomatic.metainfo.xml:28
msgid "This tool aims to solve that. Hash-o-matic comes with a simple &amp; clean UI, allowing anyone, from any age and experience group, to generate, compare and verify MD5, SHA-256 and SHA-1 hashes."
msgstr "Esta ferramenta pretende cambiar iso. Hash-o-matic inclúe unha interface sinxela e limpa que permite a calquera, de calquera grupo de idade ou de experiencia, xerar, comparar e verificar sumas de comprobación MD5, SHA-256 e SHA-1."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#. +> trunk6
#: org.kde.hashomatic.metainfo.xml:33
msgid "Hash-o-Matic also support verifying a file with the help of a PGP signature."
msgstr "Hash-o-Matic tamén permite verificar un ficheiro coa axuda dunha sinatura PGP."

#. (itstool) path: screenshot/caption
